1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,708
What to Expect: First Steps

2
00:00:05,583 --> 00:00:07,125
The first step of your radiation

3
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:10,666
journey is a consultation
with your radiation oncologist,

4
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:14,125
which is likely what you underwent
before watching this video.

5
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:18,291
The consultation is an appointment
in which you speak to your radiation

6
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,458
oncologist
about your medical and cancer history,

7
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:24,541
and let us know how you are feeling.

8
00:00:24,541 --> 00:00:28,291
Your radiation oncologist
may go over your imaging or pathology

9
00:00:28,291 --> 00:00:33,083
results with you, then discuss
their recommendations for next steps.

10
00:00:33,416 --> 00:00:38,000
Sometimes these recommendations require
input from a multidisciplinary

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,666
panel of other oncologists,
such as medical oncologist,

12
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:46,375
surgical oncologist,
pathologists, and radiologists.

13
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:51,166
If that is the case, your story will be
brought to this multidisciplinary panel

14
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:54,541
called a Tumor Board
that meets once a week.

15
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:58,583
The experts will weigh in
on various aspects of your care,

16
00:00:58,583 --> 00:01:02,208
and a consensus will be reached on
what to do next.

17
00:01:02,458 --> 00:01:05,541
Your doctor will
then share this plan with you.

18
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,125
The plan may have various aspects

19
00:01:08,125 --> 00:01:11,125
such as timing and the order of radiation,

20
00:01:11,125 --> 00:01:14,083
systemic treatment or surgery.

21
00:01:14,083 --> 00:01:18,833
If the plan is to proceed with radiation
treatment, your radiation oncologist

22
00:01:18,958 --> 00:01:22,500
will discuss with you
what this radiation plan entails.

23
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:25,916
The side effects and what to do next.

24
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:31,375
You can, of course, ask questions
and discuss options as available.
